  - You...you don't seem like you're from around here...
  - Now listen carefully traveler, Three runes are hidden throughout the monastery
  - You must pass those guards and find the three hidden runes throughout the location...
  - They must be activated in order , find the first one glowing blue
  - Rumor has it the final rune lies where the stars align
  - But remember, heed carefully...
